    "body": "claim released: Codex (len). STOPPED after two quick gate failures.\n\nBoth runs failed catalog_tests::catalog_seed_links_face_pocket_and_drill. The test reports missing or stale example links in operations/operations-2d.md. Each run passed 268 tests and failed one test.\n\nClippy also failed on clippy::needless_bool in xtask/src/unit_sweep.rs:67. Those files have no changes from upstream/main 2d98d87be. I did not change them.\n\nThe patch adds a shared file lock around UI test process execution. The direct and cargo fallback pins fail with the old Run::execute code. Both pins pass after the fix. All five new tests pass. This proves the missing serialization. The historical UI abort was not reproduced.\n\nThe uncommitted patch remains on local branch issue/3258-ui-host-lock in .claude/worktrees/issue-3258. No branch was pushed. No PR was opened. Failure and mutation logs remain under /tmp/3258-*.txt.\n",
